  "question": {
    "text": "The value of the integral <math><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
