  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let, <math><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br />(As <math><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></math> is an odd function)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p>"
  }
